From bf6ff1d3b5f1ec6be6423d64bc7499e788a64d4d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Salis Dev <dev@salis.app>
Date: Sun, 12 Jul 2026 16:25:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(dashboard): full redesign with Salis identity
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Architecture:
- Extract useProducts hook — encapsulates Convex products queries/mutations
- Extract useOrders hook — encapsulates orders + computed stats
- New types/index.ts — Product, Order, ProductFormData with full type safety
- Remove all 'any' usage — strict TypeScript throughout

UI:
- Replace all Tailwind classes with Salis CSS variables
- Login page with Salis coral gradient
- Stats cards: total orders, pending, shipped, revenue
- Products table with Salis tokens
- Orders table with STATUS_CONFIG object (data-driven UI)
- ProductForm: proper validation without alert(), success state
- LoadingSpinner and EmptyState helper components

Design System:
- index.css: full Salis token set matching storefront
- Dark mode via [data-theme=dark] — same system as storefront
